  └─ ƒ suggestPieceMeta({"data":{"blocksText":"One piece, five readers. A Mycelium piece is not a fixed article — each block can carry a Skim, Standard, Expert, Teach and Debate variant, and the reader chooses the depth. \n\n1 · Blocks are the unit of thought\n\n  \n\n Tip: the Inspector on the right sets mode visibility per block. Hide a deep-dive block from Skim and it simply disappears for readers in a hurry. \n\n The best writing tool is the one that shows the reader exactly as much as they asked for. \n\n Mode visibility lives on the block, so one publish serves all five reading modes — there is no second draft to keep in sync. \n\n The honest objection: five variants sounds like five times the work. The composer answers with per-block AI variant generation, and any mode you skip falls back to Standard. \n\n Semantic roles — thesis, evidence, counter, footnote — are stored on the block. That is what lets the Debate view assemble both sides of an argument automatically. \n\n2 · Show your work\n\n Prose alone rarely carries a technical argument. These blocks put the evidence inline, right where the claim is made. \n\n// every block declares which reading modes it belongs to\nexport const defaultVisibility = () => ({\n  skim: true,\n  standard: true,\n  expert: true,\n  teach: true,\n  debate: true,\n});\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n3 · Make it stick, then get paid\n\n\n\n If a reader only ever uses Skim, is the Expert variant wasted work — or is it exactly what makes Skim trustworthy? \n\nTask switching imposes a measurable reconfiguration cost.\n\n Supporters-only: the exact tip split, the payout schedule, and how earnings credit can fund your Studio plan all live behind this block. Mark any block supporters-only in the Inspector and members read it while everyone else sees a locked teaser. \n\n That is the studio: nineteen block types, five reading modes, branches for alternate framings, debate rooms for disagreement, and tiers, bundles and tips for getting paid. Everything above was written in the composer you are about to open.","title":"Mycelium Studio — The Complete Guided Tour"}}) in 493ms actions/ai.ts
